A.eoP=new B.cs("F-2-7 \xb7 \uc810\uc218\uc81c \uc6b0\uc218\uc778\uc7ac\nX\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\xfang nh\xf3m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\xe9t tr\u01b0\u1edbc, r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec3m.","F-2-7 \xb7 \uc810\uc218\uc81c \uc6b0\uc218\uc778\uc7ac\nConfirm the eligible category first, then review its points requirements.")
A.eor=new B.cs("F-2-7 l\xe0 di\u1ec7n c\u01b0 tr\xfa d\xe0nh cho nh\xe2n t\xe0i theo h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m. Visa Navigator m\xf4 t\u1ea3 vi\u1ec7c \u0111\xe1p \u1ee9ng c\u1ea3 nh\xf3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u0111i\u1ec3m theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn v\xe0 c\xe1c y\xeau c\u1ea7u kh\xe1c; m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng \u0111i\u1ec3m t\u1ef1 t\xednh kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 k\u1ebft lu\u1eadn.","F-2-7 is the points-based talent residence route. Visa Navigator describes eligible categories, the required score and other conditions; a self-calculated total alone does not establish eligibility.")
A.eox=new B.cs("B\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c t\u1eadp h\u1ee3p l\u1ecbch s\u1eed c\u01b0 tr\xfa, h\u1ecdc v\u1ea5n, c\xf4ng vi\u1ec7c, thu nh\u1eadp v\xe0 ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn ti\u1ebfng H\xe0n. H\u1ecfi c\u01a1 quan ph\u1ee5 tr\xe1ch nh\xf3m n\xe0o ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\xe0 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd n\xe0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\xednh.","Start by organising your residence history, education, work, income and Korean-language certificates. Ask which category fits your case and which evidence counts.")
