A.iNL=new B.t("en-kiip-5-50-q4","What is the best definition of population aging?","\u201c\uace0\ub839\ud654\u201d\uc758 \ub73b\uc73c\ub85c \uac00\uc7a5 \uc54c\ub9de\uc740 \uac83\uc740 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc785\ub2c8\uae4c?","Population aging is an increase in the proportion of older people in the total population.",A.a5n,0)
